{
    "title": "Solitaire - Classic Card Game",
    "description": "Get ready to immerse yourself in the addictive world of Solitaire game! If you're a fan of classic card games, you're in for a treat. Indulge in the ultimate Solitaire experience, now available on your mobile device!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccf Immerse yourself in the exciting world of the Solitaire game!\r\n\ud83d\udd22 Test your card-playing skills with this amazing FREE solitaire game.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Get ready for a classic Solitaire adventure like no other!\r\n\r\nPrepare to be captivated as you embark on a thrilling journey through various captivating solitaire card challenges. Whether you're a seasoned card player or a novice, our Solitaire app offers an unrivaled gaming experience that will keep you coming back for more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf06 Play Solitaire games anytime, anywhere\u2014no internet connection required.\r\n\u23f0 Make the most of your spare time with an addictive Solitaire card game during your daily commute or while waiting.\r\n\ud83d\udc51 Aim high and conquer the Daily Solitaire Challenges to become the ultimate Solitaire King or Queen!\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain while you unwind after a long day.\r\n\r\nDid you know Solitaire is one of the world's most popular classic card games? It has stood the test of time for generations, captivating players with its blend of strategy and relaxing path. If you've enjoyed playing Solitaire card games on your computer, get ready to fall in love with this mobile version!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Key Features \ud83d\udca1\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Enjoy a wide variety of Solitaire games on the go, no matter where you are.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Switch between Landscape and Portrait modes for your comfort.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Compatible with a wide range of devices\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Move cards with a simple tap or a smooth drag-and-drop motion.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Available in multiple languages, making it accessible to Solitaire players worldwide.\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Special Features \u2b50\ufe0f\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Left-handed mode\u2014perfectly tailored for left-handed Solitaire players.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Auto-complete option for lightning-fast wins in Solitaire card games.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Dive into thrilling daily Solitaire challenges and unlock incredible rewards.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Personalize your Solitaire game with various card faces, backs, and backgrounds and win animations!\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Need a helping hand? Use hints to overcome tricky situations in Solitaire.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Choose between Solitaire Draw-1 or Draw-3 cards mode for added challenge.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Keep track of your progress with detailed personal statistics in Solitaire games.\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Experience the classic Solitaire card mode or try exciting Solitaire game variations like Solitaire Race! \ud83c\udfc1\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0e How to play this free original solitaire card game \ud83d\ude0e\r\nTo solve this FREE Solitaire card puzzle, move all solitaire cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the Solitaire Foundations. There is one deck - 52 solitaire cards in the classic Solitaire game.\r\n\r\nYou must stack solitaire cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move solitaire cards between columns, and stack solitaire cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. You can move the stack of solitaire cards by dragging the whole stack to another column.\r\n\r\nSolitaire game or Patience game is an addictive solitaire card game from the Classic Solitaire collection, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri-Peaks, Pyramid, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon.\r\n\r\nClassic never fades. Solitaire, or Patience is the best way to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere with patience and insistence. You would love playing this free Solitaire card game.\r\n\r\nThink you have what it takes to claim the title of Solitaire King or Queen? \ud83d\udc51\ud83e\udd34 Don't miss out\u2014download now and join the ever-growing community of Solitaire players on Android.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to immerse yourself in the addictive world of Solitaire game! If you&#39;re a fan of classic card games, you&#39;re in for a treat. Indulge in the ultimate Solitaire experience, now available on your mobile device!<br><br>\ud83c\udccf Immerse yourself in the exciting world of the Solitaire game!<br>\ud83d\udd22 Test your card-playing skills with this amazing FREE solitaire game.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Get ready for a classic Solitaire adventure like no other!<br><br>Prepare to be captivated as you embark on a thrilling journey through various captivating solitaire card challenges. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned card player or a novice, our Solitaire app offers an unrivaled gaming experience that will keep you coming back for more.<br><br>\ud83c\udf06 Play Solitaire games anytime, anywhere\u2014no internet connection required.<br>\u23f0 Make the most of your spare time with an addictive Solitaire card game during your daily commute or while waiting.<br>\ud83d\udc51 Aim high and conquer the Daily Solitaire Challenges to become the ultimate Solitaire King or Queen!<br>\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain while you unwind after a long day.<br><br>Did you know Solitaire is one of the world&#39;s most popular classic card games? It has stood the test of time for generations, captivating players with its blend of strategy and relaxing path. If you&#39;ve enjoyed playing Solitaire card games on your computer, get ready to fall in love with this mobile version!<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 Key Features \ud83d\udca1<br>\u2660\ufe0f Enjoy a wide variety of Solitaire games on the go, no matter where you are.<br>\u2660\ufe0f Switch between Landscape and Portrait modes for your comfort.<br>\u2660\ufe0f Compatible with a wide range of devices<br>\u2660\ufe0f Move cards with a simple tap or a smooth drag-and-drop motion.<br>\u2660\ufe0f Available in multiple languages, making it accessible to Solitaire players worldwide.<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f Special Features \u2b50\ufe0f<br>\u2666\ufe0f Left-handed mode\u2014perfectly tailored for left-handed Solitaire players.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Auto-complete option for lightning-fast wins in Solitaire card games.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Dive into thrilling daily Solitaire challenges and unlock incredible rewards.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Personalize your Solitaire game with various card faces, backs, and backgrounds and win animations!<br>\u2666\ufe0f Need a helping hand? Use hints to overcome tricky situations in Solitaire.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Choose between Solitaire Draw-1 or Draw-3 cards mode for added challenge.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Keep track of your progress with detailed personal statistics in Solitaire games.<br>\u2666\ufe0f Experience the classic Solitaire card mode or try exciting Solitaire game variations like Solitaire Race! \ud83c\udfc1<br><br>\ud83d\ude0e How to play this free original solitaire card game \ud83d\ude0e<br>To solve this FREE Solitaire card puzzle, move all solitaire cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the Solitaire Foundations. There is one deck - 52 solitaire cards in the classic Solitaire game.<br><br>You must stack solitaire cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move solitaire cards between columns, and stack solitaire cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. You can move the stack of solitaire cards by dragging the whole stack to another column.<br><br>Solitaire game or Patience game is an addictive solitaire card game from the Classic Solitaire collection, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri-Peaks, Pyramid, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon.<br><br>Classic never fades. Solitaire, or Patience is the best way to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere with patience and insistence. You would love playing this free Solitaire card game.<br><br>Think you have what it takes to claim the title of Solitaire King or Queen? \ud83d\udc51\ud83e\udd34 Don&#39;t miss out\u2014download now and join the ever-growing community of Solitaire players on Android.",
